=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Ceraulian} inside Cargo Room A to begin this quest. Agree to help obtain a {i:Gold Hairpin|Gold Hairpin|12494}
** **From this point on, you can change to any other job to complete the quest.**
* Trade him a {i:Gold Hairpin|Gold Hairpin|12494} for a cutscene.
** {i:Gold Hairpin +1|Gold Hairpin +1|13849} will not work
* Wait one minute, then speak to him again. You may need to zone. Speaking to {n:Miaux} as mentioned below now will give bonus dialogue.
* Speak to {n:Miaux}, {z:Northern San d'Oria} (E-6) to receive a {k:Shiny earring}.
* Speak to {n:Ardea}, {z:Bastok Markets} (H-8).

:* She stands in front of the Goldsmithing Guild, next to home point #4.
:* If you have started the quest {q:Rock Racketeer|Rock Racketeer|Rock Racketeer}, you must finish it before {n:Ardea} will let you continue this quest.

* Next, speak to {n:Esca}, {z:West Ronfaure} (F-6).
* Head to the island in {z:Batallia Downs} (I-11).
** The only way to get to the island is to first go through {z:The Eldieme Necropolis}.
** To reach the room at (G-9) you will need to bring someone to operate the gates for you, or have a {@k} {k:Magicked astrolabe}.
** Enter {z:The Eldieme Necropolis} at (I-10) in {z:Batallia Downs}. Or teleport using the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:The Eldieme Necropolis}.
** Once inside hug the South side until you reach a large room at (G-9). Fall through the grave at the center of this room at point D into map 2. All the enemies in this section sound aggro even at 99.
** After dropping down go to point E to zone into map 3, from here follow the path going south to exit to {z:Batallia Downs} again.

!The Eldieme Necropolis-map1.jpg||The Eldieme Necropolis map 1
!The Eldieme Necropolis-map2.jpg||The Eldieme Necropolis map 2
!The Eldieme Necropolis-map3.jpg||The Eldieme Necropolis map 3
* Examine the **???** at (I-11) to spawn the NM {m:Sturmtiger}.
** This is on the west side of the island, not the east side, at cliff's edge.
* Examine the **???** again after {m:Sturmtiger} is defeated to get {k:Ranchuriome's legacy}.
* Return to {n:Ceraulian} for your reward.

